               BEFORE THE NEW MEXICO PUBLIC REGULATION COMMISSION
Order Granting Motion to File Testimony Out of Time      Docket No. 25-00082-UT



       5.      The requested relief will not prejudice any party or the Commission and will not

disturb any subsequent deadline established in the Order Establishing Revised Procedural

Schedule and Addressing Outstanding Motions.

       6.      Good cause exists to grant the Motion.

       IT IS THEREFORE ORDERED:

       A.      Stephen Fischmann’s Motion to File Testimony Out of Time is GRANTED.

       B.      The direct testimonies of Joel Hornstein and Mark Ellis shall be ACCEPTED AS

FILED on the date on which they are filed into this docket, barring any unforeseen reasons for the

denial of the filings of the testimony, and so long as they are filed on or before October 29, 2026.

ISSUED under the Seal of the Commission at Santa Fe, New Mexico, on October 28, 2026.

